<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?>
<!--
 | Migration-equivalence fixture: fixture-zoe's own layout, as uPortal 5.17.9 exported it after
 | fixture-zoe customised the layout through the portal's layout API (/api/layout):
 |   renameTab        the fixture fragment's first tab (dlm:editSet)
 |   removeElement    calendar from the Welcome fragment (dlm:deleteSet)
 |   addTab           "Mine ✓ « » &" with two columns, then changeColumns to 25% / 75%
 |   addPortlet       snappy and fixture-rich-content into the new tab
 |   moveElement      xkcd from the fixture fragment into the new tab (dlm:positionSet)
 |   addFavorite      phd-comics (the favorites fragment)
 | Fragment nodes are named by fragment owner and path, so the file is the same on every database.
 | Re-record it the same way (on 5.17) if the fixture fragments change.
 +-->
